# Brinelab Tower (CIPlay brinelab_tower): the lobby, the safety board, the reception drawer (machete plans), the vines
# over the hatch, the stairwell, the boars, lab 2's cabinet, drive 1, the flooded lab, drives 2 and 3 (drive 3 hidden
# until drive 2 is read; it sends "drives"), the pipe store, the boiler room locker.
island Brinelab Tower
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Lab Tower
zone lobby
expect step 1
read Lab safety board
expect step 2
open Reception drawer
wait 3
expect step 3
expect shown atriumvines
expect item Machete 1
use atriumvines
expect hidden atriumvines
zone stairwell
expect step 4
kill Warthog
expect step 5
open Lab 2 cabinet
wait 3
expect step 7
read Data drive 1
expect step 8
read Dr Sato's roof recording
# (reach|flooded_lab is counted early on this route)
zone flooded_lab
air flooded_lab
expect step 10
open Pipe store
wait 3
expect step 12
open Lab stores
wait 3
open Boiler room locker
wait 3
expect step 13
# side dive (not a step): the pump house chest holds this island's crest shard for the Hollow's crown vault
air bl_dair
open Pump house chest
wait 3
expect step 13
expect hidden drive3
read Data drive 2
expect shown drive3
read Data drive 3
expect done
